>s
(first opening the south door)

Hallway
This short L-shaped hallway runs from a wooden door to the north to an open
archway to the west.  There is also a small door set in the east wall.  A large
portrait of uncle Wout dominates the south wall.

You see a leather satchel here.


>look behind portrait
You find a wall safe behind the portrait.

(Your score has just increased by one point.)

>x safe
It's a combination wall safe.  There is a single dial on it.  There's also a
small label on the safe.  It’s closed.  It’s currently locked.


>x label
The label is glued to the safe door.  There are some doodles on it that look
like a bottle, a goblet and finally something unrecognizable.  It might be a
table, a desk, or a box.


>take satchel
Taken.


>open satchel
Opening the leather satchel reveals a snorkel.


>e
(first trying to open the small door)
The small door seems to be locked.


