>w
Main Street
This is the cobbled main street of the village which has grown around the
sprawling estate over time.  The impressive front door of the stately villa of
Korenvliet is to the east, while there is a small supermarket to the west and a
village clinic to the southwest.  A narrow path leads to a forest to the south,
and there seems to be a vacant lot to the north.


>n
Vacant lot
This is a vacant lot filled with rubble.  It seems the municipality was going
to build something here, but never got round to it.  Of course, there's not too
much going on in this village, which exists by the graces of the vast
Korenvliet estate.

You can see the main street to the south, while a rocky path leads off to the
east.


>e
Rocky path
You are walking down a rocky path that leads from a vacant lot to the west to
the edge of a landfill to the east.

A fishing net lies discarded along that path.


>take net
Taken.


>e
Edge of a landfill
This is the edge of a large landfill.  The terrain drops sharply to the east so
that you cannot continue on in that direction.  A rocky path leads west.  A
large wooden sign is stuck in the ground here.


>x sign
The text on the sign is mostly faded; it was probably some information about
the construction project going on here.  However, someone has scrawled some
graffiti on the sign: "A suitable spot."


>build balloon
Using the items you have collected, you set to work on building a hot-air
balloon.  The book you've read provides guidance and while it takes some hours
of work, in the end you get it done.  It will fly.


>fly balloon
Amazingly, your contraption works.  By regulating the heat of the burning wood
stove, you manage to lift off the balloon and soar off into the skies.  With
careful maneuvering, you set it down on the plateau in the middle of the
landfill.

Plateau
This is a raised plateau in the middle of the landfill.  For some reason, this
small elevation was spared while everything else was dug up.  The ground drops
quite sharply around the edges.  There is an old barn to the north.

There is a hot-air balloon here.


>n
Abandoned barn
This is a rickety, abandoned barn.  Its walls are made of wooden planks that
are quite rotted in places and the floor is covered in dust.  The barn is empty
apart from lots of cobwebs and an old wooden table.  An exit leads out to the
plateau.


>x table
The wooden table is old and worn.  Someone has scratched the number "19" into
its surface.


>s
Plateau
This is a raised plateau in the middle of the landfill.  For some reason, this
small elevation was spared while everything else was dug up.  The ground drops
quite sharply around the edges.  There is an old barn to the north.

There is a hot-air balloon here.


>fly balloon
You get in your hot-air balloon and fly it back to the edge of the landfill.

